<title>USA: IMC-Agrico mulls Chinese venture.</title>
<headline>IMC-Agrico mulls Chinese venture.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>IMC-Agrico Co said Thursday it entered into an exclusive letter of intent to jointly conduct feasibility studies with Chinese authorities, and, if commercially viable, to jointly develop phosphate ore resources in China.</p>
<p>IMC-Agrico is a joint venture between IMC GLobal Inc and Freeport-McMoRan Resource Partners L.P.  </p>
<p>The agreement was entered into with the Yunnan Provincial Petroleum &amp; Chemical Industry Bureau and the Yunnan Phosphorus Chemical Industry Corp, the company said.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
